          "409": {
            "description": "Existing S2 conflict. PLAN_CONCURRENT_MODIFICATION covers stale need or duty version. A resolved case, changed plan, inactive membership or live edit lease also refuses the decision. Idempotency conflicts include in-progress attempts and different commands under a retained key. Business and audit writes roll back; an admitted failed attempt may leave a FAILED idempotency row. Codes: PLAN_CONCURRENT_MODIFICATION, CANCELLATION_ALREADY_RESOLVED, REPLACEMENT_NEED_NOT_OPEN, CANCELLATION_PLAN_CHANGED, CANCELLATION_ASSIGNMENT_NOT_ACTIVE, RESOURCE_EDIT_LOCKED, IDEMPOTENCY_KEY_REUSED_WITH_DIFFERENT_REQUEST, IDEMPOTENCY_REQUEST_IN_PROGRESS.",
            "headers": {
